# Every pull request asks @princesseke for a review, and the branch ruleset requires her approval
# before it can be merged: as the only code owner, hers is the only approval that counts.
#
# GitHub never asks the author to review their own pull request, so a pull request Princess opens
# has no code owner to approve it; it can only be merged by an admin through the ruleset's bypass.
# Add a second owner to this file if her pull requests should go through review too.
#
# Owners have to be user accounts or @org/team names with write access. The organisation itself
# (@gigabytedevelopers) is neither, which is why this file used to match nobody and no review was
# ever requested automatically.
*       @princesseke

# The release machinery and anything that touches signing deserves a second look.
/.github/                   @princesseke
/app/build.gradle           @princesseke
/cliff.toml                 @princesseke
